# CSVs are stored byte for byte, with no end-of-line normalisation.
#
# Three of the files in data/ are supplied by the assessment and are quoted as
# unmodified; letting Git rewrite their line endings on checkout would make that false on
# any platform whose native ending differs from the one they were committed with. The
# generated prediction files get the same treatment so a clone on another platform does
# not show 12,000 changed lines that are not changes.
*.csv -text
